    },
    {
      "id": "t_wake", "type": "text", "x": 425, "y": 88, "width": 310, "height": 185,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a9a", "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 10004, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "What wakes the loop (step 3 unblocks):\n\n• Source fd becomes readable\n  → data arrived on watched handle\n\n• Timer fires\n  → interval elapsed\n\n• Wakeup signal\n  → executeOnRunLoop() posted a callable\n  → addSource/removeSource called\n  → stop() called\n  → addTimer/removeTimer called\n\nAll wake the loop by writing to the\nwakeup pipe/event.",
      "originalText": "What wakes the loop (step 3 unblocks):\n\n• Source fd becomes readable\n  → data arrived on watched handle\n\n• Timer fires\n  → interval elapsed\n\n• Wakeup signal\n  → executeOnRunLoop() posted a callable\n  → addSource/removeSource called\n  → stop() called\n  → addTimer/removeTimer called\n\nAll wake the loop by writing to the\nwakeup pipe/event.",
      "autoResize": true, "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "wake_sources", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

    {
      "id": "exceptions", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 310, "width": 320, "height": 100,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aA",
      "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 11001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 11002,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "t_exc", "type": "text"}],
      "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "t_exc", "type": "text", "x": 425, "y": 318, "width": 310, "height": 85,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aAa", "roundness": null,
      "seed": 11003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 11004, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "Exception handling:\n\nIf a handler/callable throws:\n1. Flags are reset (m_running, m_stopRequested)\n2. Exception propagates out of run()\n3. Loop is restartable — call run() again\n\nOS poll failure → throws std::system_error",
      "originalText": "Exception handling:\n\nIf a handler/callable throws:\n1. Flags are reset (m_running, m_stopRequested)\n2. Exception propagates out of run()\n3. Loop is restartable — call run() again\n\nOS poll failure → throws std::system_error",
      "autoResize": true, "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "exceptions", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

    {
      "id": "guarantees", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 440, "width": 320, "height": 80,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aB",
      "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 12001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 12002,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "t_guar", "type": "text"}],
      "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "t_guar", "type": "text", "x": 425, "y": 448, "width": 310, "height": 65,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aBa", "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 12004, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1774700000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "Guarantees:\n• Handlers run sequentially (no concurrency)\n• Posted callables run in FIFO order\n• removeSource from handler is safe\n• stop() from handler is safe",
      "originalText": "Guarantees:\n• Handlers run sequentially (no concurrency)\n• Posted callables run in FIFO order\n• removeSource from handler is safe\n• stop() from handler is safe",
      "autoResize": true, "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "guarantees", "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
